lent to $A={x\\in {R}_{0}^{+}:9{x}^{2}+4\\le 4}?$" :question/worked-solution "The elements of the given set are the positive real numbers and zero that satisfy the inequality $9{x}^{2}+4\\le 4.$ \n\nSo, we first need to solve our inequality for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9{x}^{2}+4 & \\le 4 \\\\ 9{x}^{2} & \\le 0 \\\\ {x}^{2} & \\le 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe only solution to the inequality above that is in ${R}_{0}^{+}$ is $x=0.$ Therefore, $A={0}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-181803/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "739c04ac-6d0c-5173-aa91-b5cc4dec8128"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-181803"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-180771/selection/2fa78ccd06aedc1eda253410d9582095267ae25a8b4f02ebec70007f2adb61f9" :answer/id #uuid "b021be71-e7df-5263-83aa-34c4665210c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\pm \\sqrt{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-180771/selection/1bc9da580064a45f2f54cd83ac8ada92fc85b17ede9b5c8bfd4f1eff91ba8297" :answer/id #uuid "ae8559fb-2d1b-5f54-89f3-3fa2a215f282" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\pm \\sqrt{5}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-180771/selection/8e1d8d0a01bef74c24bb4bacaabffe05651ce9dc211ee4fd3981a00cd6dbc743" :answer/id #uuid "d02d277c-3226-553b-94ff-977a662cfd85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\pm 5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-180771/selection/2531b01062963bf17cb1953367062769d91dcfc4519f4f6b120c5de4951d40dd" :answer/id #uuid "2b5995b1-06ac-510e-86d6-4419d82814d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "∅" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-180771/selection/b63230c945f7434b195288d145b46db7d83cf28b167eefc32041501007d5bfd5" :answer/id #uuid "fda82dc1-4085-5a5e-b54e-20d0a80a5a35" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{0,\\pm \\sqrt{5}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-180771/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6316