& =-9 \\\\ x & =\\pm \\sqrt{-9} \\\\ x & =\\pm 3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, since $x\\in R$ and $\\pm 3\\text{i}\\notin R,$ we conclude that the set $A$ contains no elements. Hence, $A=∅.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-181790/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "739c04ac-6d0c-5173-aa91-b5cc4dec8128"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-181790"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-181773/selection/2531b01062963bf17cb1953367062769d91dcfc4519f4f6b120c5de4951d40dd" :answer/id #uuid "0c84f2aa-2f8e-5a59-b160-6da05be9ee04" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "∅" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181773/selection/bd0dea35ba5c16120744c9a7dc5b65dfe4ea7d611d5170ae2a661ed734b781d7" :answer/id #uuid "6efd377a-dfbe-5590-a3f6-46ec259d6f48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{-7,-5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181773/selection/b4f7a8ae4f24716af6b2827857425ffec7ef17a06d09cf111851ab7fd3d1c0f6" :answer/id #uuid "3b0b858d-3e2e-508a-905e-95331611e4f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{5,7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181773/selection/1cadfe5daa8813c0100dfc316e32d2ee9b480a523c61048a596cae00176b2e3f" :answer/id #uuid "f3c58495-bd4d-5fac-8931-6288073dcaaa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{5,6,7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181773/selection/7ccaaf3361b67db12f1877a6cf471727cb74b4d1ed910d20bdf217cafb29097c" :answer/id #uuid "0a0469c4-9fde-58cd-b4e8-93cc3472dd78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[-7,-5]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181773/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5b50ee55-ea0c-53be-9ecd-3166557c26c3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-181773/selection/2531b01062963bf17cb1953367062769d91dcfc4519f4f6b120c5de4951d40dd" :answer-field/choices ["q-181773/selection/2531b01062963bf17cb19533